# The OLD standalone menu editor (a root-level `editor/` folder using the
# service-role key) must never be deployed. It has since been deleted, but we keep
# this rule ANCHORED to the repo root (`/editor`) in case it ever reappears.
#
# CRITICAL: the leading slash is REQUIRED. An unanchored `editor` matches ANYTHING
# named editor anywhere — including `app/editor`, `app/api/editor` and
# `public/panels/editor` (the manager panel), which silently 404'd the manager
# panel on every Vercel deploy until this was anchored.
/editor
